ility  of this aircraft after an identical  model operated by lion airlines  crashed into the sea off the indonesian  coast last october  american aircraft manufacturer boeing  said it was deeply saddened  and would assist in the investigation  rescue workers have yet to recover the  plane's flight data recorder  but officials hope it will reveal how  this tragedy  unfolded john sparks sky news  ethiopia
 

